      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "info_section",
      "content": "## Properties Reference\n\n**Moment of Inertia (I):** Resistance to bending, measured in cm⁴\n- Ix: About major (horizontal) axis\n- Iy: About minor (vertical) axis\n\n**Elastic Section Modulus (W):** Stress distribution under load, measured in cm³\n- Wx: About major axis\n- Wy: About minor axis\n\n**Sectional Area:** Cross-sectional area in cm²\n\n**Weight:** Per meter of beam length in kg/m\n\n**Conversion Factors:**\n- 1 cm⁴ = 10⁴ mm⁴ = 10⁻⁸ m⁴ = 0.024 in⁴\n- 1 cm³ = 10³ mm³ = 10⁻⁶ m³ = 0.061 in³\n- 1 cm² = 10² mm² = 10⁻⁴ m² = 0.16 in²\n- 1 kg/m = 0.67 lb/ft"
